questions.questionText:
A researcher estimates the relationship between reproductive success (𝑁, number of offspring) and horn length (𝐻, in cm) in a wild goat as

𝑁= 40 -2.2𝐻+ 0.04𝐻^{2}

Horn length typically varies from 10 cm to 50 cm in this species. Which one of the following graphs correctly represents this relationship?

